 gray:"3. ชาย 40 ปี CT brain non-contrast เจอดังภาพ What is the most common cause? [รูป CT] — a. Essential hypertension b. Ruptured AVM c. Ruptured aneurysm",
 opts:["Essential hypertension","Ruptured arteriovenous malformation","Ruptured aneurysm","Cerebral amyloid angiopathy","Hemorrhagic transformation of an infarct"],
